# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 181
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:181
msgid ""
"Auto: Detects the best settings based on your hardware.\n"
"Zswap is used when disk space is at least 5x your RAM.\n"
"Otherwise, Zram is used to save disk space.\n"
"\n"
"In Auto mode, all parameters are optimized automatically\n"
"and advanced settings are hidden."
msgstr ""
"Automaatne: Tuvastab teie riistvara põhjal parimad seaded.\n"
"Zswapi kasutatakse, kui kettaruumi on vähemalt 5x teie RAM-ist.\n"
"Vastasel juhul kasutatakse kettaruumi säästmiseks Zrami.\n"
"\n"
"Automaatrežiimis optimeeritakse kõik parameetrid automaatselt\n"
"ja täpsemad seaded on peidetud."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 189
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:189
msgid ""
"Zstd: Better compression ratio, stores more data in less RAM.\n"
"Recommended for most systems — modern CPUs handle it efficiently.\n"
"\n"
"LZ4: Faster but lower compression. Only useful if CPU is very slow."
msgstr ""
"Zstd: Parem pakkimissuhe, salvestab vähemasse RAM-i rohkem andmeid.\n"
"Soovitatav enamiku süsteemide jaoks — kaasaegsed protsessorid tegelevad sellega tõhusalt.\n"
"\n"
"LZ4: Kiirem, kuid madalam tihendus. Kasulik ainult siis, kui protsessor on väga aeglane."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 194
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:194
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Maximum percentage of RAM reserved for the zswap compressed cache.\n"
"Higher = more data cached in RAM before writing to disk.\n"
"Lower = more free RAM for applications.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: 25-50% depending on workload."
msgstr ""
"Maksimaalne RAM-i protsent, mis on reserveeritud zswapi tihendatud vahemälu jaoks.\n"
"Kõrgem = rohkem andmeid vahemälus RAM-is enne kettale kirjutamist.\n"
"Madalam = rohkem vaba RAM-i rakenduste jaoks.\n"
"\n"
"Soovitatav: 25–50% olenevalt töökoormusest."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 201
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:201
msgid ""
"Virtual (uncompressed) size of the zram block device.\n"
"With compression, actual RAM usage is much less.\n"
"Example: 80% with 3:1 compression uses ~27% of real RAM.\n"
"\n"
"Higher values allow storing more compressed data."
msgstr ""
"Zrami plokkseadme virtuaalne (tihendamata) suurus.\n"
"Tihendamisel on tegelik RAM-i kasutus palju väiksem.\n"
"Näide: 80% 3:1 tihendamisega kasutab ~27% tegelikust RAM-ist.\n"
"\n"
"Kõrgemad väärtused võimaldavad salvestada rohkem tihendatud andmeid."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 207
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:207
msgid ""
"Zstd: Better compression ratio, saves more memory.\n"
"Recommended for all systems — modern CPUs handle it well.\n"
"\n"
"LZ4: Faster but compresses less. May waste RAM."
msgstr ""
"Zstd: Parem tihendussuhe, säästab rohkem mälu.\n"
"Soovitatav kõigile süsteemidele – kaasaegsed protsessorid saavad sellega hästi hakkama.\n"
"\n"
"LZ4: Kiirem, kuid tihendab vähem. Võib raisata RAM-i."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 233
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:213
msgid ""
"Creates swap files on disk when RAM is full.\n"
"Files grow and shrink automatically as needed.\n"
"Uses progressive scaling: starts small, doubles as demand increases.\n"
"\n"
"Requires a supported filesystem (btrfs, ext4, or xfs)."
msgstr ""
"Loob kettale saalefailid, kui RAM on täis.\n"
"Failid kasvavad ja kahanevad vastavalt vajadusele automaatselt.\n"
"Kasutab progressiivset skaleerimist: algab väikesest, kahekordistub nõudluse kasvades.\n"
"\n"
"Nõuab toetatud failisüsteemi (btrfs, ext4 või xfs)."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 239
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:219
msgid ""
"Base size for each new swap file.\n"
"With progressive scaling, this is the starting size.\n"
"Files 1-4: base size, Files 5-8: 2x, Files 9-12: 4x, etc.\n"
"\n"
"512MB: Good for most systems.\n"
"1GB: Better for systems with 8GB+ RAM."
msgstr ""
"Iga uue saalefaili baassuurus.\n"
"Progressiivse skaleerimise korral on see algsuurus.\n"
"Failid 1-4: baassuurus, Failid 5-8: 2x, Failid 9-12: 4x jne.\n"
"\n"
"512 MB: Hea enamiku süsteemide jaoks.\n"
"1 GB: Parem 8 GB+ RAM-iga süsteemidele."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 254
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:227
msgid ""
"Total physical memory (RAM) installed in the system.\n"
"This is the hardware limit — applications and OS share this pool."
msgstr ""
"Süsteemi installitud füüsiline mälu (RAM) kokku.\n"
"See on riistvara piirang – rakendused ja OS jagavad seda kogumit."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 258
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:231
msgid ""
"Memory currently in use by applications and the system.\n"
"Includes active processes, libraries, and kernel allocations."
msgstr ""
"Rakenduste ja süsteemi poolt praegu kasutatav mälu.\n"
"Sisaldab aktiivseid protsesse, teeke ja tuuma eraldisi."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 262
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:235
msgid ""
"Memory available for new allocations.\n"
"Includes free RAM plus reclaimable file cache and buffers.\n"
"This is the practical indicator of how much RAM is free."
msgstr ""
"Uute eraldiste jaoks saadaval mälu.\n"
"Sisaldab vaba RAM-i pluss taastatavat failide vahemälu ja puhvreid.\n"
"See on praktiline näitab, kui palju RAM-i on vaba."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 267
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:240
msgid ""
"Memory used for disk buffers and file cache.\n"
"The kernel reclaims this automatically when applications need RAM.\n"
"High values here are normal and indicate efficient disk caching."
msgstr ""
"Kettapuhvrite ja failide vahemälu jaoks kasutatav mälu.\n"
"Tuum nõuab selle automaatselt tagasi, kui rakendused vajavad RAM-i.\n"
"Kõrged väärtused on siin normaalsed ja näitavad tõhusat ketta vahemälu salvestamist."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 273
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:246
msgid ""
"Total swap space available across all backends.\n"
"Combines zram (compressed in RAM), zswap, and disk swap files."
msgstr ""
"Kogu saaleruum on saadaval kõigis taustaprogrammides.\n"
"Ühendab zrami (tihendatud RAM-is), zswapi ja ketta saalefailid."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 277
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:250
msgid ""
"Swap data stored in compressed RAM (zswap pool or zram).\n"
"Faster than disk swap — data is compressed and kept in memory."
msgstr ""
"Tihendatud RAM-i salvestatud vahetusandmed (zswapi bassein või zram).\n"
"Kiirem kui ketta vahetus – andmed tihendatakse ja hoitakse mälus."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 281
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:254
msgid ""
"Swap data written to disk (swap files or partitions).\n"
"Slower than in-RAM swap. Used when compressed cache is full."
msgstr ""
"Kettale kirjutatud vahetusandmed (vahetusfailid või sektsioonid).\n"
"Aeglasem kui RAM-i vahetus. Kasutatakse siis, kui tihendatud vahemälu on täis."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 286
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:259
msgid ""
"RAM used by the zswap compressed cache pool.\n"
"Zswap intercepts pages being swapped out and compresses them in RAM\n"
"before they reach the disk, reducing I/O significantly."
msgstr ""
"Zswapi tihendatud vahemälukogumi poolt kasutatav RAM.\n"
"Zswap püüab väljavahetatavad lehed kinni ja tihendab need RAM-i\n"
"enne kettale jõudmist, vähendades oluliselt I/O-d."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 291
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:264
msgid ""
"Original (uncompressed) size of data stored in zswap.\n"
"Compare with Pool size to see how much RAM compression saves."
msgstr ""
"Zswapi salvestatud andmete algne (pakkimata) suurus.\n"
"Võrrelge basseini suurusega, et näha, kui palju RAM-i tihendamine säästab."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 295
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:268
msgid ""
"Compression ratio of zswap data.\n"
"Higher = more data fits in less RAM. Typical zstd ratio: 2-4x.\n"
"Example: 3.0x means 3 GB of data fits in ~1 GB of RAM."
msgstr ""
"Zswapi andmete tihendussuhe.\n"
"Kõrgem = rohkem andmeid mahub vähemasse RAM-i. Tüüpiline zstd suhe: 2-4x.\n"
"Näide: 3,0x tähendab, et 3 GB andmemahtu mahub ~1 GB RAM-i."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 301
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:274
msgid ""
"Virtual (uncompressed) size of the zram block device.\n"
"This is the maximum amount of data zram can hold before compression.\n"
"Actual RAM usage depends on the compression ratio."
msgstr ""
"Zrami plokkseadme virtuaalne (tihendamata) suurus.\n"
"See on maksimaalne andmemaht, mida zram suudab enne tihendamist hoida.\n"
"Tegelik RAM-i kasutus sõltub tihendusastmest."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 306
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:279
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Data currently stored in zram, compressed in RAM.\n"
"With zstd compression, actual RAM usage is typically 30-50% of this."
msgstr ""
"Praegu zramis salvestatud andmed, mis on tihendatud RAM-is.\n"
"Zstd-tihenduse korral on tegelik RAM-i kasutus tavaliselt 30–50% sellest."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 310
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:283
msgid ""
"Compression ratio of zram data.\n"
"Formula: original data size / compressed size.\n"
"Higher = better compression. Typical zstd ratio: 2-4x."
msgstr ""
"Zrami andmete tihendussuhe.\n"
"Valem: andmete algsuurus / tihendatud suurus.\n"
"Kõrgem = parem tihendus. Tüüpiline zstd suhe: 2-4x."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 316
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:289
msgid ""
"Number of dynamic swap files and their total usage.\n"
"Files are created and removed automatically as demand changes."
msgstr ""
"Dünaamiliste saalefailide arv ja nende kogukasutus.\n"
"Nõudluse muutumisel luuakse ja eemaldatakse failid automaatselt."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 320
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:293
msgid ""
"Copy all current statistics to the clipboard.\n"
"Useful for sharing diagnostics or reporting issues."
msgstr ""
"Kopeerige kogu praegune statistika lõikelauale.\n"
"Kasulik diagnostika jagamiseks või probleemidest teatamiseks."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 325
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:298
msgid ""
"Shows if the swap management service is running.\n"
"Green = active and managing swap automatically.\n"
"Gray = stopped or not installed."
msgstr ""
"Näitab, kas vahetuse haldusteenus töötab.\n"
"Roheline = aktiivne ja haldab vahetust automaatselt.\n"
"Hall = peatatud või pole installitud."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 330
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:303
msgid ""
"The current swap mode in use.\n"
"In Auto mode, the system detects the optimal configuration."
msgstr ""
"Praegune kasutusel olev vahetusrežiim.\n"
"Automaatrežiimis tuvastab süsteem optimaalse konfiguratsiooni."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 334
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:307
msgid "View application information and version."
msgstr "Vaadake rakenduse teavet ja versiooni."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 335
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:308
msgid "Access main menu, restore defaults, and quit."
msgstr "Avage peamenüü, taastage vaikeväärtused ja väljuge."
# File: biglinux-systemd-swap-gui/src/biglinux_swap/utils.py, line: 336
#: src/biglinux_swap/utils.py:309
msgid "Apply current configuration changes to the system."
msgstr "Rakendage süsteemile praegused konfiguratsioonimuudatused."
